---
import { createAboutModel } from "../../lib/about/model";
type AboutModel = ReturnType<typeof createAboutModel>;
interface Props { model: AboutModel; }
const { model } = Astro.props;
---
<article class="about-content" data-module-order={model.modules.join(",")}><h1>About Faisal Albalwy</h1><section><h2>Short biography</h2><p>Faisal Albalwy is an Assistant Professor in the Department of Cybersecurity at Taibah University and a researcher focused on trustworthy digital systems.</p></section><section><h2>Extended context</h2><p>Research connects cybersecurity and privacy questions with blockchain, smart contracts, encryption, federated learning, and machine-learning methods for threat detection.</p></section><section><h2>Current role and affiliation</h2><p>{model.appointment}</p><p>Institutional affiliation: Taibah University</p></section><section><h2>Academic and leadership career</h2><ul>{model.leadership.map((activity) => <li>{activity}</li>)}</ul></section><section><h2>Education</h2><p>{model.phd}</p><p>Doctoral thesis: <cite>A BLOCKCHAIN INFRASTRUCTURE TO SUPPORT SMART CONTRACTS-BASED CONSENT MODELS FOR CLINICAL GENOMICS</cite>.</p><p><a href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/studentTheses/a-blockchain-infrastructure-to-support-smart-contracts-based-cons/">View the institutional thesis record (external)</a></p></section><section><h2>Academic context</h2><p>The doctoral and publication records connect secure data sharing, consent, and privacy with blockchain security, system interoperability, and cyber-threat detection.</p>{model.profile ? <p><a href={model.profile.href}>{model.profile.label}</a></p> : null}</section><section><h2>Affiliation and related routes</h2><p>This is Faisal Albalwy's personal academic website. Taibah University is shown as his institutional affiliation; this is not an official Taibah University website.</p><p><a href="/research">Explore research</a> <a href="/publications">View publications</a> <a href="/teaching">Teaching</a> <a href="/leadership-service">Leadership &amp; Service</a> <a href="/contact">Contact</a></p></section></article>
